          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was outstanding among “The Thirty”, but not as famous as “The Three”. David put him in charge of his bodyguard.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
